-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §61: the employers report to the Ministry of
-- Education, in their current reports and through the school principals,
-- on all the teaching employees employed in the schools they own.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`

§ `61`

DECLARE `Oz section 61 action` IS ONE OF
    `report to the Ministry on all the teaching employees in the schools it owns`

-- ¶1: the employers report, within the current reports they send the
-- Ministry (no day of their own: convention dates.no-deadline), through
-- the principals, on every teaching employee in the schools they own.
@ref akn:art_61/p1
`reporting the teaching employees to the Ministry` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `report to the Ministry on all the teaching employees in the schools it owns`
